{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Tiny Delivery",
    "steam_appid": 3812830,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812830/extras/0610_2_.gif?t=1754951237\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a small food delivery robot with a simple task \u2014 to bring an order to its destination. But the journey becomes much more than just a delivery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812830/extras/0610_7_.gif?t=1754951237\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll through a charming neighborhood, weave through alleys and parks, and experience the everyday lives of the people around you. Children might invite you to bike races, an old man needs help getting an apple from a tree, and a stray cat may just hitch a ride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812830/extras/0610_6_.gif?t=1754951237\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny Delivery is a short, heartfelt adventure filled with little stories \u2014 some joyful, some bittersweet. You\u2019ll find hidden secrets, spontaneous moments, and gentle reminders of life\u2019s quiet beauty.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812830/extras/0610_2_.gif?t=1754951237\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a small food delivery robot with a simple task \u2014 to bring an order to its destination. But the journey becomes much more than just a delivery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812830/extras/0610_7_.gif?t=1754951237\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll through a charming neighborhood, weave through alleys and parks, and experience the everyday lives of the people around you. Children might invite you to bike races, an old man needs help getting an apple from a tree, and a stray cat may just hitch a ride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812830/extras/0610_6_.gif?t=1754951237\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny Delivery is a short, heartfelt adventure filled with little stories \u2014 some joyful, some bittersweet. You\u2019ll find hidden secrets, spontaneous moments, and gentle reminders of life\u2019s quiet beauty.</p>",
    "short_description": "It\u2019s a cozy adventure about a small delivery robot on a short but unforgettable journey. Deliver your package through a vibrant town, meet new people, stumble upon both funny and touching moments, discover hidden treasures, and soak in the world around you.",
